        "original_id": "c8d05b0e-0b7c-5b8a-b71f-f1ba6540e99a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bebe Rexha, David Guetta, G-Eazy, Martin Garrix, Cash Cash, Nicki Minaj, Afrojack\n- Products: \"Me, Myself & I\", \"Hey Mama\", \"In the Name of Love\", \"Take Me Home\"\n- Topics: Billboard Hot 100, featured guest vocals\n\nFacts:\n- Bebe Rexha is best known as a featured guest vocalist on several Billboard Hot 100 charting songs.\n- Those songs include G-Eazy's \"Me, Myself & I\", David Guetta's \"Hey Mama\", Martin Garrix's \"In the Name of Love\", and Cash Cash's \"Take Me Home\".\n- \"Hey Mama\" is a song by David Guetta.\n- \"Hey Mama\" features vocals from Nicki Minaj and Bebe Rexha.\n- \"Hey Mama\" also includes production from Afrojack.",
